{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/gif9-2025.gif?t=1739656093\" /><i>Magin: The Rat Project Stories</i> takes place in a dark fantasy world, where magic \u2013 or essence, as it is called \u2013 is directly tied to the desires and fears of its inhabitants. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape the fate of Elester, a Magin and veteran hitman in an underworld syndicate, as well as young Tolen, who is about to realize that he too can use the essence to his advantage. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a mature, magical world standing on the edge of an industrial revolution and utter chaos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome obstacles, play your cards wisely, and find your destiny in this immersive, story-driven adventure. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/Steam_Text_Label_1.png?t=1739656093\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore atmospheric and mysterious locations by investigating the environment, and interacting with items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle horrific creatures and meet numerous complex characters - potential allies or foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/gif-adventure2shots.gif?t=1739656093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/Steam_Text_Label_3.png?t=1739656093\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your essence by utilizing emotions, both in combat and during exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The emotional state of your character influences the story and various gameplay mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/gif7-2025.gif?t=1739656093\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/Steam_Text_Label_2.png?t=1739656093\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a cold and harsh fantasy world where medieval culture is confronted with the invention of industrial, magic-powered machines, and the forces that seek to control them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the main characters on their journey of lost and redeemed hope and decide its outcome based on your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/gif6-2025.gif?t=1739656093\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/Steam_Text_Label_4.png?t=1739656093\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage and upgrade your deck as the story progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain special cards from story choices and defeated enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft unique double-sided, emotion-infused essence cards fitting your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/gif-fights-shorter.gif?t=1739656093\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1205270?t=1739656093","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739656093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739656093","capsule_im